  "question": {
    "text": "Equation of a plane at a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>21</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units from the origin, which contains the line of intersection of the planes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;is"
